- A one-page teaching handout (summary, key quotes, discussion questions).
- A thematic essay (700–1,000 words) on charity vs. law (using the bishop & Noreen scenes).
- A list of notable quotations you can cite, with brief explanations.
- Turn this into an email/summary to send someone (I can draft it).

